_:c14n1 <https://github.com/cardano-foundation/CIPs/blob/master/CIP-0185/README.md#updateContext> "Following the community town hall on April 15th, we are clarifying the budget breakdown for milestone 2. The figure stated in the proposal covers audit costs only; engineering costs for milestone 2 are covered by the milestone 1 disbursement, as several DReps asked."@en-us .
_:c14n1 <https://github.com/cardano-foundation/CIPs/blob/master/CIP-0185/README.md#updateType> "Clarification" .
_:c14n2 <https://github.com/cardano-foundation/CIPs/blob/master/CIP-0185/README.md#body> _:c14n1 .
_:c14n3 <https://github.com/cardano-foundation/CIPs/blob/master/CIP-0185/README.md#bindingStatement-field> "milestones[2].budget"@en-us .
_:c14n3 <https://github.com/cardano-foundation/CIPs/blob/master/CIP-0185/README.md#bindingStatement-originalText> "Milestone 2: 150,000 ada"@en-us .
_:c14n3 <https://github.com/cardano-foundation/CIPs/blob/master/CIP-0185/README.md#bindingStatement-rationale> "Two defensible readings existed; this fixes the intended one without changing any amount."@en-us .
_:c14n3 <https://github.com/cardano-foundation/CIPs/blob/master/CIP-0185/README.md#bindingStatement-revisedText> "Milestone 2: 150,000 ada, covering third-party audit costs only; engineering costs are covered under milestone 1."@en-us .
